{"agent": {"state": {"session_id": "1788683410000-3fabc6", "summary": "", "context": [{"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "两张大单同时要 9/25 交货，产线排不开怎么办？", "id": "53d6acf24d0d41c7abbc6c5cc90936e2", "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:30:10", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "92a2125da75c4cd8a7708c9a6d8c228e", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:30:10", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "89c06be9d4744ab1addfb2846444c202", "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:30:18", "finished_at": "2026-09-06T08:30:50"}, {"type": "text", "text": "三个处理选项：\n1. **分批交付**：先交 60% 应急，余量 9/30 前补齐（需客户书面确认）；\n2. **外协支援**：装盒环节外协，损失约 3% 毛利保交期；\n3. **加班冲单**：本周起两班倒各加 2h，预计可追回 4 天产能。\n建议 1+3 组合，先与客户沟通确认。", "id": "e2ba856abf2949a9999658030b37ddc6", "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:30:18", "finished_at": "2026-09-06T08:30:50"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "2a851a1fb3374365b007781c053d1ccf", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:30:18", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-06T08:30:50", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "外协的话质量怎么控制？", "id": "748a66cd91ee415aa0cf1f99dc0ac1f9", "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:32:10", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "47b9a42baa244524bb5eee025267124b", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:32:10", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "理解用户诉求后，结合公司数据与制度作答，保持简洁准确。", "id": "beaa8d4ba3f142c08f21cf608c57f9f2", "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:32:18", "finished_at": "2026-09-06T08:32:50"}, {"type": "text", "text": "外协四步控：① 提供全套 SOP 与检验标准；② 首件送检合格后批量；③ 我方驻厂中检（每 2 小时抽检）；④ 到货按 AQL 1.0 抽验，不合格整批退回。外协厂需先过质量体系审核。", "id": "1566edc00fea4b8590ead10242809930", "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:32:18", "finished_at": "2026-09-06T08:32:50"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "ccadc061eeae4c829471c9b10cea1b20", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:32:18", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-06T08:32:50", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "user", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "客户不同意分批怎么办？", "id": "76c4d21c368e4885af53e8941089fd59", "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:33:50", "finished_at": null}], "role": "user", "id": "7fc4d8fc981e46dfa0762a9ac718001a", "metadata": {"qwenpaw_tag": "external_user_query"}, "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:33:50", "usage": null, "finished_at": null, "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}, {"name": "Default Agent", "content": [{"type": "thinking", "thinking": "结合公司制度与实际业务场景，给出可执行的答复。", "id": "ec4227db042340a8ae696c832f6477ae", "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:33:56", "finished_at": "2026-09-06T08:34:35"}, {"type": "text", "text": "那就在 2、3 里选：外协保交期是商业承诺优先，加班冲单是成本优先。实在都不行，提前一周正式发函说明延期并给出新交期——主动沟通的延期和被动爆雷的延期，客户观感完全两样。", "id": "9b35c1f60f7149efaf2633e9bb5b179b", "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:33:56", "finished_at": "2026-09-06T08:34:35"}], "role": "assistant", "id": "650cddb444204b71bfaaf3d22b7b949a", "metadata": {}, "created_at": "2026-09-06T08:33:56", "usage": null, "finished_at": "2026-09-06T08:34:35", "finished_reason": null, "structured_output": null, "error": null}], "reply_context": {}, "permission_context": {}, "tool_context": {}, "tasks_context": {}, "middle_context": {}}}}